  "prefLabel": "Plc 1004.09 Jurisprudence Examination Fees for Funeral Directors",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1004.09 Jurisprudence Examination Fees for Funeral Directors. The fee for the jurisprudence examination for funeral directors as regulated by the board of registration of funeral directors and embalmers under RSA 325 shall be $40.\n\nSource. #14244, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 4-23-25; ss by #14377, eff 10-8-25, EXPIRES: 10-8-35 (formerly Plc 1004.08)",
